WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:12.730
- [Interviewer] All right, Monty?

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:14.568
- Yes.
- Monty, where are you from?

00:00:14.568 --> 00:00:16.710
